{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15303760","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15303760","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1530376001:1":{"text":"나 빼고, 온 가족이 다 홍수에 떠내려갔어!","source_cn":"我家里除了我，全被洪水冲走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC46A38DBBB50A339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530376002:1":{"text":"나도 그래. 이제 보칼리스에 남은 친구는 너 하나뿐이야.","source_cn":"我也一样，现在的呼临城，我只有你一个朋友了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CD1864724FDA427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530376003:1":{"text":"홍수가 날 줄 알았다면, 나도 그냥 남아서 가족들과...","source_cn":"早知道城里会发洪水，我就应该留在城里，和家人们一起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63D4743DD88862DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530376004:1":{"text":"그런 생각하지 마, 친구! 적어도 우리는 살았잖아.","source_cn":"别，别这样想，我的朋友，起码我们还活着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x690935A5C2D16752","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修昔底德":{"text":"튜키디데스","source":"修昔底德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雷尔":{"text":"레르","source":"雷尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}